  sentences:
  - text: I arrive beside her again, but when I see her I notice several injuries
      on her body.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I arrive beside her again, but when I see her I notice several injuries on her body.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Those hooligans used their weapons against her?!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm fine! Just continue what you're doing!
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Even though I'm worried about her, it's surprising to see how well she
      can fight.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I sprint over to the duke and the remaining guards try to stop me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see Amon pulling out his sword in that moment.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet, watch out!
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I collide with the duke and feel several hands trying to pull me off of
      him, so I start the second shift.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9ffb0342e8c37ca41a593df06f3a93ab, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0c2a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e7c, type: 2}

